  "answer": "### Short Answer\nThe last day to file the individual annual income tax return is April 15 of the following year after the taxable year.\n\n### Interpretation\n\n### Practical Meaning\nTaxpayers should ensure that their income tax returns are filed by this deadline to avoid penalties and interest on any unpaid taxes. It is advisable to prepare and submit the return well in advance of the deadline to account for any potential issues that may arise during the filing process.",
